      "width": 360,
      "height": 93.75,
      "roundness": null,
      "text": "package.create — уроки\nlessonCount · remaining = lessonCount\nunitPrice = price / lessonCount, вниз\nproductId + productName · managerId\nstatus = PENDING",
      "originalText": "package.create — уроки\nlessonCount · remaining = lessonCount\nunitPrice = price / lessonCount, вниз\nproductId + productName · managerId\nstatus = PENDING",
